.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt IGT_RUNNER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm igt_runner ,
.Nm igt_comms_decoder
.Nd run IGT's GPU and display tests and record their results
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar option ...
.Ar test_root
.Ar results
.Nm
.Fl L
.Op Ar option ...
.Ar test_root
.Nm igt_comms_decoder
.Ar file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs the tests of IGT, the kernel's test suite for DRM drivers, one subtest at a time, and writes what each printed, the kernel's log over its run and its outcome under the directory
.Ar results ,
which it makes.
The x86-64 GNU root has IGT 2.0's tests, built from Debian's intel-gpu-tools source, in
.Pa /usr/libexec/igt-gpu-tools ,
the
.Ar test_root
to give; the variable
.Ev IGT_TEST_ROOT
overrides it.
At its end
.Nm
writes
.Pa results.json ,
and prints
.Ql Done.
.Pp
.Nm
runs as root and refuses another user without
.Fl -allow-non-root .
.Pp
The options most runs use:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl L , Fl -list-all
Print every subtest that would run, as
.Ql igt@ Ns Ar test Ns @ Ns Ar subtest ,
one a line, and run nothing.
No
.Ar results
is given.
.It Fl t Ar regex , Fl -include-tests Ar regex
Run only the subtests whose names match.
It may be given more than once.
.It Fl x Ar regex , Fl -exclude-tests Ar regex
Leave out the subtests whose names match.
.It Fl -test-list Ar file
Run the subtests that
.Ar file
names, one a line.
.It Fl m , Fl -multiple-mode
Run consecutive subtests of one test in one execution of it.
.It Fl d , Fl -dry-run
Write the job list in
.Ar results
and run nothing;
.Xr igt_resume 1
runs it.
.It Fl o , Fl -overwrite
Remove
.Ar results
first if it exists.
.It Fl -per-test-timeout Ar seconds , Fl -inactivity-timeout Ar seconds
Kill a subtest that runs, or prints nothing, for longer.
.It Fl -allow-non-root
Run as another user.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print every option and its meaning.
.El
.Pp
.Nm igt_comms_decoder
prints, one packet a line, the
.Pa comms
file of a subtest's results, which records the test's messages to the runner.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /usr/libexec/igt-gpu-tools
The tests, their libraries in
.Pa lib ,
the list of tests
.Pa test-list.txt
and the list of every subtest
.Pa subtest-list.txt ,
which
.Ql igt_runner -L /usr/libexec/igt-gpu-tools
prints the same on Rach2 as in the Debian guest that built them.
.It Pa /usr/share/igt-gpu-tools
The images the display tests draw.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 when the run ends, whatever its subtests' results, 1 when it cannot start the run, run it or write its results, and 2 when the overall timeout stopped it.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Run the vblank subtests of kms_vblank and keep the results in
.Pa /tmp/r :
.Pp
.Dl igt_runner -t 'igt@kms_vblank@.*' /usr/libexec/igt-gpu-tools /tmp/r
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr igt_resume 1 ,
.Xr intel-gpu-tools 1 ,
.Xr modetest 1
